@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `usca-operation-of-statutes`
IMPORT `usca-definitions`

-- Tests of usca-definitions.l4.  Each expected value is decided from the section cited above the assertions, before the run: a member the section
-- names is TRUE; a member a section excludes is FALSE; a thing outside a definition by inclusion is REFUSED (the section does not say there are no
-- others); a thing outside a definition by meaning is FALSE.  A failing assertion is a finding.

§ `The table has one entry for each definition the 26 sections give`

#ASSERT count `the table of defined terms` EQUALS 26

§ `The table of defined terms: every entry`

